# Auth Module API
# Version: 2026.10.21_1

## Authentication Endpoints

### User Login
POST /api/v1/auth/login
Request: {"username": "string", "password": "string", "platform": "web|vk|telegram|max"}
Response: {
  "status": "success|error",
  "token": "string",
  "user_id": "string",
  "username": "string", 
  "roles": ["array"],
  "expires_in": "number",
  "message": "string"
}
Error codes: 100 (Invalid credentials), 101 (Account locked), 102 (Account disabled)

### User Logout
POST /api/v1/auth/logout
Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

### Session Validation
GET /api/v1/auth/session
Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
Response: {
  "status": "valid|invalid|expired",
  "user_id": "string",
  "username": "string",
  "roles": ["array"],
  "expires_at": "timestamp"
}

## Registration Endpoints

### Register New User
POST /api/v1/auth/register
Request: {
  "phone": "string",
  "password": "string",
  "email": "string",
  "first_name": "string",
  "last_name": "string",
  "agree_terms": "boolean",
  "platform": "web|vk|telegram|max"
}
Response: {
  "status": "success|error",
  "user_id": "string",
  "message": "string"
}
Error codes: 200 (Registration disabled), 201 (Invalid data), 202 (Username exists), 203 (Phone exists)

### Verify Phone Number
POST /api/v1/auth/verify-phone
Request: {"phone": "string", "code": "string"}
Response: {
  "status": "success|error",
  "verified": "boolean",
  "message": "string"
}

### Resend Verification Code
POST /api/v1/auth/resend-code
Request: {"phone": "string"}
Response: {
  "status": "success|error",
  "message": "string",
  "retry_after": "number"
}

## User Management Endpoints

### Get User List
GET /api/v1/auth/users
Headers: Authorization: Bearer <admin_token>
Query params: page=number, limit=number, role=string
Response: {
  "users": [
    {
      "user_id": "string",
      "username": "string",
      "phone": "string",
      "email": "string",
      "first_name": "string",
      "last_name": "string",
      "roles": ["array"],
      "status": "active|disabled|locked",
      "created_at": "timestamp",
      "last_login": "timestamp"
    }
  ],
  "total": "number",
  "page": "number",
  "limit": "number"
}

### Get User Details
GET /api/v1/auth/users/{user_id}
Headers: Authorization: Bearer <admin_token>
Response: {
  "user_id": "string",
  "username": "string",
  "phone": "string",
  "email": "string",
  "first_name": "string",
  "last_name": "string",
  "roles": ["array"],
  "status": "active|disabled|locked",
  "created_at": "timestamp",
  "last_login": "timestamp",
  "chat_platforms": [{"platform": "string", "user_id": "string", "username": "string"}]
}

### Update User
PUT /api/v1/auth/users/{user_id}
Headers: Authorization: Bearer <admin_token>
Request: {
  "username": "string",
  "phone": "string", 
  "email": "string",
  "first_name": "string",
  "last_name": "string",
  "roles": ["array"],
  "status": "active|disabled"
}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

### Delete User
DELETE /api/v1/auth/users/{user_id}
Headers: Authorization: Bearer <admin_token>
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

## Role and Group Management Endpoints

### Get Roles List
GET /api/v1/auth/roles
Headers: Authorization: Bearer <admin_token>
Response: {
  "roles": [
    {
      "role_id": "string",
      "name": "string",
      "description": "string",
      "permissions": ["array"]
    }
  ]
}

### Create Role
POST /api/v1/auth/roles
Headers: Authorization: Bearer <admin_token>
Request: {
  "name": "string",
  "description": "string",
  "permissions": ["array"]
}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "role_id": "string", "message": "string"}

### Assign Role to User
POST /api/v1/auth/users/{user_id}/roles
Headers: Authorization: Bearer <admin_token>
Request: {"roles": ["array"]}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

## Authorization Check Endpoints

### Check Permission
POST /api/v1/auth/check-permission
Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
Request: {"permission": "string", "resource": "string"}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "allowed": "boolean", "message": "string"}

### Get User Permissions
GET /api/v1/auth/permissions
Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
Response: {
  "status": "success|error",
  "permissions": ["array"]
}

## Integration Endpoints

### Menu Integration - Register Menu Items
POST /api/v1/auth/menu/register
Headers: Authorization: Bearer <admin_token>
Request: {
  "items": [
    {
      "type": "button|command",
      "label": "string",
      "command": "string",
      "visible_for_roles": ["array"],
      "platform": "all|web|vk|telegram|max"
    }
  ]
}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

### Get Menu Items for User
GET /api/v1/auth/menu
Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
Response: {
  "status": "success|error",
  "items": ["array"]
}

## Web Console Specific

### Web Login (Session based)
POST /api/v1/auth/web/login
Request: {"username": "string", "password": "string"}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "session_id": "string", "user": "object"}

### Web Session Check
GET /api/v1/auth/web/session
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {"status": "valid|invalid", "user": "object"}

## Data Models

### User Object
{
  "user_id": "uuid",
  "username": "string",
  "phone": "string",
  "email": "string",
  "first_name": "string", 
  "last_name": "string",
  "password_hash": "string",
  "salt": "string",
  "roles": ["admin", "customer", "anonymous"],
  "status": "active|disabled|locked",
  "chat_platforms": [
    {
      "platform": "vk|telegram|max",
      "platform_user_id": "string",
      "platform_username": "string",
      "access_token": "string",
      "refresh_token": "string"
    }
  ],
  "created_at": "ISO8601",
  "updated_at": "ISO8601",
  "last_login": "ISO8601"
}

### Session Object
{
  "session_id": "uuid",
  "user_id": "uuid",
  "token": "string",
  "expires_at": "ISO8601",
  "created_at": "ISO8601",
  "platform": "web|vk|telegram|max",
  "ip_address": "string",
  "user_agent": "string"
}

## Role Definitions
- **anonymous**: No history, no personal data storage
- **customer**: Can use bot functions, has persistent history
- **admin**: Full access, can configure bot and modules

## Permission Definitions
- auth:login
- auth:register
- auth:manage_users
- auth:manage_roles
- auth:view_logs
- core:manage_modules
- web:access_admin
- menu:configure
- llm:configure
- multichat:configure
- datastore:configure
- apps:manage
